    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God of Terra: Crestfallen</strong> is a solo-developed third person shooter that  blends power fantasy gameplay with souls-like  encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/bc5daafaa873bb1060ebfe4a6ce55fd9.avif?t=1754781213\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The long night is finally over, and the light of the Martyr shines upon us once more. Yet the forces of evil still plague our lands&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For thirty years the last remnants of humanity remained secluded in the Spire - a tower-fortress serving as the last beacon of light amidst the tide of darkness. At last, the long night is over, and we are free to roam the lands of our ancestors. Alas, there is no telling of how far the corruption has spread. Explore the land, purge the corruption, and may the wrath of the Martyr guide your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/0cfcf1fc4ff5725f52b972c914a03526.poster.avif?t=1754781213\" width=706 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/0cfcf1fc4ff5725f52b972c914a03526.webm?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/0cfcf1fc4ff5725f52b972c914a03526.mp4?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lands surrounding the Spire and progress through the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging encounters to earn upgrade resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an unstoppable force of light by upgrading your weapons and armor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/161e972a645fb7d7b01a60962b4dc79d.poster.avif?t=1754781213\" width=562 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/161e972a645fb7d7b01a60962b4dc79d.webm?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/161e972a645fb7d7b01a60962b4dc79d.mp4?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God of Terra: Crestfallen</strong> is a solo-developed third person shooter that  blends power fantasy gameplay with souls-like  encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/bc5daafaa873bb1060ebfe4a6ce55fd9.avif?t=1754781213\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The long night is finally over, and the light of the Martyr shines upon us once more. Yet the forces of evil still plague our lands&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For thirty years the last remnants of humanity remained secluded in the Spire - a tower-fortress serving as the last beacon of light amidst the tide of darkness. At last, the long night is over, and we are free to roam the lands of our ancestors. Alas, there is no telling of how far the corruption has spread. Explore the land, purge the corruption, and may the wrath of the Martyr guide your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/0cfcf1fc4ff5725f52b972c914a03526.poster.avif?t=1754781213\" width=706 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/0cfcf1fc4ff5725f52b972c914a03526.webm?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/0cfcf1fc4ff5725f52b972c914a03526.mp4?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lands surrounding the Spire and progress through the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging encounters to earn upgrade resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an unstoppable force of light by upgrading your weapons and armor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/161e972a645fb7d7b01a60962b4dc79d.poster.avif?t=1754781213\" width=562 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/161e972a645fb7d7b01a60962b4dc79d.webm?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351610/extras/161e972a645fb7d7b01a60962b4dc79d.mp4?t=1754781213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
